values
  ('isolved', 'iSolved', 'hr', 'Employees, employment status, start/end dates, departments, managers, employment type; iSolved is a source system for continuous compliance evidence.', 'REST API / OAuth / API key / SCIM depending on vendor. Query audit-relevant resources and normalize the returned objects. Do not pull unnecessary content or secrets.', '1) Admin opens Integrations. 2) Selects iSolved. 3) Creates/chooses tenant/account. 4) Grants least-privilege read scope (write only for optional remediation). 5) Completes OAuth/API/service-account authorization. 6) Selects resource scope. 7) Validates connection. 8) Starts initial sync. Prefer read-only service account; sync on schedule; normalize employee identity by email/employee ID.', 'Map employees, employment status, start/end dates, departments, managers, employment type to canonical GRC objects. Store source_system, tenant_id, resource_type, resource_id, evidence_type, collected_at, observed_at, owner, control_ids, connector_version and payload hash/reference.', 'Vanta Help Center → HR / HRIS → search exact product ''iSolved''. https://help.vanta.com/en/collections/18953568-hr-systems-hris', 3, 'catalogued'),
