  ('weights_biases_w_b', 'Weights & Biases (W&B)', 'ai', 'Maintain immutable audit trail of training datasets, hyperparameters, and lineage.', 'Pulls dataset hashes, run configs, and checkpoint eval metrics.', 'Add W&B Service Account API Token in integrations.', 'Map dataset versions and metrics to EU AI Act Art. 10 and ISO 42001 A.8.3.', 'Vanta Help Center -> AI Infrastructure', 3, 'catalogued'),
